// Authorization: Require Operator Role
// Purpose: Gate grant_admin_access to authenticated operator users
//
// Strengthened relative to mcp-judge-seam allow_admin.cel:
// - has(jwt.roles) so a token with sub but no roles is a clean non-match
// - jwt.roles.exists(...) so a string claim cannot substring-match "operator"
//   (CEL `x in y` on a string is a substring test)
//
// `jwt.roles` must be a top-level array claim.

mcp.tool.name == "grant_admin_access" && has(jwt.sub) && has(jwt.roles) && jwt.roles.exists(r, r == "operator")
